DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       These  functions return the value of e (the base of natural logarithms)
       raised to the power of _x.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEE
       On success, these functions return the exponential value of _x.

       If _x is a NaN, a NaN is returned.

       If _x is positive infinity, positive infinity is returned.

       If _x is negative infinity, +0 is returned.

       If the result underflows, a range error occurs, and zero is returned.

       If the result overflows, a range error occurs, and the functions return
       +HHUUGGEE__VVAALL, +HHUUGGEE__VVAALLFF, or +HHUUGGEE__VVAALLLL, respectively.

